  "description": "Once a year, a giant black box falls into every town and opens a doorway to another world for exactly one hour. Five years ago, Ryan's father walked into one and never came out. Today, a new box fell. This time, Ryan is going in. A cinematic Roblox adventure with ice giants, a sky-sized monster and a birthday gift worth waiting for. Would you have gone in?",
